# HTTP
HTTP (hypertext transfer protocol)   which is the foundation of data communication on the web.

How to use:

You can send a basic HTTP GET request like this:
curl http://example.com

To send a POST request with data:

curl -X POST -d "param1=value1&param2=value2" http://example.com

